      "note": "The first seconds: one Isaac Sim mission run twice with the same boulder in the compactor's lane (docs/eval/2026-10-26-isaac-cosmos-ab, via slides/eval). Left, no perception: CP1 is written off and CP-SAT proves T8 has no robot. Right, Cosmos Reason 2 on its camera: blocked, not broken; it goes around and every task is done at hour 72. Both clips: mission hours 34-38 in 10 s; the stall at 4.0 s.",
